      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Dataset EDA: histogram + safe text cast\n\n**Dataset \u2192 Histogram** aggregates EVERY numeric column of a `DATASET` server-side (bin counts, mean/std/min/max per column) and renders an in-node canvas chart with hover bin read-outs \u2014 the plotted column is switchable from the combo WITHOUT re-running (the payload rides the ui channel and is saved with the workflow).\n\n**Dataset Unpack** splits a single column out; **Convert** casts anything to its declared type (`match link` auto-fills the combo from whatever is wired), so text consumers like **SaveText** never crash on raw tensors \u2014 this is the graph-level fix for `write() argument must be str, not int`. **Dataset \u2192 Preview** shows the table head as a text report."
      ],
      "title": "How this works"
    },
